<pb n="246" facs="#f0260"/>
<p>Indem die po&#x017F;itiv-electri&#x017F;che Materie in <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#b">C</hi></hi> angeha&#x0364;uft i&#x017F;t,<lb/>
